A frontmatter value carrying `|` is escaped in its cell, so the rendered row still splits into
the four columns the header declares instead of five.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/one/index.md --
---
title: "A | B"
status: done
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --glob 'plans/*/index.md'
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
| title | status | path | slug |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| A \| B | done | plans/one/index.md | one |
-- stderr --
